mb|1H|mb|1S|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Most Norths would pass, and that is reasonable. But |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at| says North could bid 3@H which is weak.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
