UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It turns out slam in either red suit is very good spot. In fact grand slam is a great contract. The only thing that beats 7@H is the 5-0 trump break, which is very unlikely--under 10%. However, it is hard to bid after the 4@C call by North. Further, 7@D is cold.|
PG| ***** 65 ***** |


