mb|1C|mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|mb|2D|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I agree with the 2@D call which is a |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=4sf,Fourth Suit Forcing - (4SF)^*N|CP||FP||at| and completely artificial. It says nothing about diamonds. It merely establishes a game force. Over |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=4sf,Fourth Suit Forcing - (4SF)^*N|CP||FP||at| next are the typical choices for opener.|
PG| ***** 67 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at| 1) Support responder's first suit (hearts here) with 3 card support; 2) bid NT with a stopper in the 4th suit (diamonds here); 3) Make some other suitable bid. It is not obvious here what West should bid but probably 3@C is best, although it takes up a lot of room. |
PG| ***** 68 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|3C|mb|P|mb|3H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Note that 3@H here is forcing, shows 6 hearts (since partner denied 3 hearts by bidding 3@C) and could be a slam try. |
PG| ***** 69 ***** |


mb|P|mb|4H|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
pg| ***** 70 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|
pc|D6|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Normally, I don't like leading away from a KJ. But on this auction, they avoided 3N so a diamond lead is very possible. It turns out not to work well here, but it is still a reasonable lead. |
PG| ***** 71 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|No other lead seems better given the auction. A black suit seems wrong given West has both black suits and a heart is obviously incorrect.|
PG| ***** 72 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The @CQ is possible. But I don't like it because West's bidding promised a long club suit, and it is usually not a good idea to lead an opponent's long suit.|
PG| ***** 73 ***** |


pc|D8|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Personally I would have played the @DQ since low means you are definitely losing a diamond. But I will let it stand.|
PG| ***** 74 ***** |


