UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|That was a good illustration of |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=4sf,Fourth Suit Forcing - (4SF)^*N|CP||FP||at|. BTW, if the auction had gone 1@C-1@H-1@S-3@H (not 2@D) by East, that is NOT forcing, although many players think it is. |
PG| ***** 88 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|3@H shows an invitational hand with very nice hearts. If for example East had the same hand without the @DA 3@H would have been the correct bid. |
PG| ***** 89 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Not bidding |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=4sf,Fourth Suit Forcing - (4SF)^*N|CP||FP||at| means partner only has at best an invite.|
