md|3S84HAKT42DQ74CAT2,SAKQT32HQ9D2CK965,S6HJ763DKT983CQJ7,SJ975H85DAJ65C843|sv|n|
mb|P|mb|P|mb|1H|mb|1S|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4h|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I like to play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenafterovercall,Bergen Raises After an Overcall ^*N|CP||FP||at| are ON in this auction, although that is not standard. So, if you played that, North would bid 3@C to show a limit raise (10-12) with 4 card support.|
