mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East should bid 4@S over 4@H, because with a 9 card spade fit, 4@S is almost always right over 4@H. There is a good bidding rule that you should follow which is 4@S is almost always right over 4@H if you have a 9-card fit in spades.|
PG| ***** 95 ***** |


mb|Pp|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West on the other hand does not have a 4@S call.|
