nt|^z@3^b@2^^|lb|*CLead for West by clicking that card on the right.^^SQ^SAKQT32|pc|SQ|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Most players would lead the @SA. However, the expert lead from @SAKQ is the @SQ, because when it wins, it is now obvious you hold the AKQ.|
